{"c":[{"id":"457442361bf86149","sum":"Script is the only writer; tox py311-py314; nested recall; skipped-a-pack; notes are clone-portable (no OptMem in the prompt); onboarding is init; version/Release Please/coverage are product; note prints Saved.; surgery.py deletes; AGPL plus 0BSD+§7 in the summem header only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"3d8e48dcd08287d1","sum":"AGENT_BIN vs CLI_NAME; VISION/ROADMAP retired (README+atlas+notes+MB). tox py311-py314; nested recall; skipped-a-pack. Script is the only writer (files are the work). Note membership is clone-portability; no OptMem in the prompt. Onboarding: docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4078d7c411ce74e3","sum":"AGENT_BIN vs CLI_NAME; VISION/ROADMAP retired for README+atlas+notes+memory-bank. tox py311-py314 no result cache; nested recall; skipped-a-pack on bad sibling; script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5e4f97413b312154","sum":"Run: uses AGENT_BIN; help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP retired; living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"667b5bd40e9be23d","sum":"Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem); help catalog uses CLI_NAME. VISION/ROADMAP sunset; living docs are README, docs/, and the memory-bank.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T023238Z-bbf825b6f524dcb6","text":"Nap Run: line uses AGENT_BIN (.summem/summem), same as the baked prompt; usage_text keeps CLI_NAME (summem).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T025054Z-8222dbc737ce85a4","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are being sunset: leftovers go under docs/; README and memory-bank become the living docs; VISION is no longer the design contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"5e022ef533bec842","sum":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md retired. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/ (the atlas), docs/notes.md leftovers, and the memory-bank. VISION is not the contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T025220Z-1a52749b783612ee","text":"docs-sunset plan: VISION/ROADMAP retire; architecture lives at docs/architecture/; leftovers (sqlite, hooks, cover(T), pack-size, hot margin) at docs/notes.md; README is the public face.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T030457Z-f1b0d73acb7f8b59","text":"VISION.md and ROADMAP.md are gone. Living docs are README, docs/architecture/, docs/notes.md, and the memory-bank. The architecture page is the atlas; VISION is not the contract.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"746cce2a386de2cd","sum":"tox is py311-py314 pytest, no result cache unless proven on this suite; recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall warn 'skipped a pack' on an unreadable sibling children file (wake silent). Script-written files are part of the work; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29530a97880a269e","sum":"tox is the pytest suite on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10; no test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite); recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr for an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T034719Z-9ead1d6adb1f23f2","text":"Niko L2 tox-pytest-runner: one tox command for pytest on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10); skip test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T035449Z-38690d9f52484de6","text":"recall matches nested NapChild.sum captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr when they skip an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1cd145ba45ef49e6","sum":"tox is the suite (py311-py314, no result cache). Files the script writes are part of the work: git-add them; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T040400Z-6f72c4e24f7307a3","text":"tox is the suite command: tox.ini package=skip, py311-py314, no test-result cache; 211 pytest. This uv only had 3.14.0rc3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T044725Z-82b67eae5e042401","text":"After note or nap, git add the files the script wrote and commit them; the script stays the only writer.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"97fbdbf480d21d0c","sum":"Script-written files are part of the work (not untracked). Note membership is clone-portability; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Too long: N/limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep; TDD skips consumer Actions YAML.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0b347fe3d88d5969","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"4826b3cd066a8db2","sum":"Files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. prompt-commit-notes archived (PR #15).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T143121Z-499b95db35c236dc","text":"Prompt: files the script writes are part of the work; do not leave them untracked. Not a separate git add procedure.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T143747Z-07042dccd58a8627","text":"prompt-commit-notes archived: files the script writes are part of your work; do not leave them untracked. Draft PR #15.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0e2730939d36cf17","sum":"Note membership is clone-portability on its own sentence; do not name OptMem in the prompt. Over-long note/nap prints Too long: N bytes, limit L; unknown id on identity-miss says copy from wake.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T144333Z-54317d52fae15bc6","text":"Note membership: session spawn 'document this machine gap' beat the baked filter because it is a trailing clause in the mandatory-note paragraph. Store/CLI stay; split the test onto its own clone-portability sentence. Do not name OptMem in the prompt.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T150951Z-48c09749f6b4d942","text":"Over-long note and nap captions print Too long: N bytes, limit L. Accented characters cost 2 bytes. Compress it further. Identity-miss unknown id says copy from wake; a missing children file does not.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"528f08ae8bb4cf55","sum":"Register Memories notes clone-portable facts (dump vs membership split); dump line does not say git forever. Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md lockstep with prompt_text(); TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e2a8c1aafb975d12","sum":"Baked Register Memories: note a fact another contributor would still need; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence (dump vs membership split). Dump line no longer says git forever.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T152829Z-ff3349020923cee6","text":"Baked Register Memories: note when another contributor would still need the fact; membership is clone-portability on its own sentence. Dump line no longer says git forever.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T165146Z-3869ac160fa1eda4","text":"Draft PR #18: baked Register Memories splits dump from clone-portability membership; no store/CLI change.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"89acc35894e248e2","sum":"Onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output. TDD does not govern consumer Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T184134Z-2efc5cdcb2d8b149","text":"Onboarding prompt is docs/agents-prompt.md, lockstep with prompt_text(); do not select wrapping init output.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T193911Z-1a2508c0f3d6386f","text":"TDD does not govern GitHub Actions YAML that only invokes a third-party action; it would if SumMem were an Action.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7adc29ef51880740","sum":"Onboarding is init; version/Release Please/coverage are product; note prints Saved.; surgery.py emergency delete; AGPL plus 0BSD+§7 in the summem header only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"460feb3ed8c0607d","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text); version prints __version__, Release Please tracks extra-files, consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD. Coverage: pytest-cov measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage uploads lcov.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1b57bafcd1f51c08","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); version-tracking archived (PR #22): version prints __version__, Release Please extra-files; consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9280565a8f63c495","sum":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()), not a docs/agents-prompt.md copy. summem version prints __version__; Release Please extra-files bump repo-root summem.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T194852Z-ea2b60e530376ca4","text":"ship-prompt-file archived; onboarding is docs/agents-prompt.md; draft PR #21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T195810Z-0def08186d21b807","text":"summem version prints __version__; Release Please simple extra-files bump repo-root summem via x-release-please-version.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"eacada5aac0af230","sum":"version-tracking archived (PR #22): summem version prints __version__; Release Please extra-files; consumer Actions YAML is not product TDD (same class as .cursor-rules#116).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T195859Z-a205a695beb1a648","text":"Preflight FAIL on consumer release-please.yaml was the same class as Texarkanine/.cursor-rules#116 (TDD encoding of tooling as product).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T203536Z-5ee598da385c9137","text":"version-tracking archived: summem version prints __version__; Release Please simple extra-files on repo-root summem; PR #22.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"94271e53e4e390e8","sum":"Coverage: pytest-cov measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage uploads lcov (PR #23).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9c098318cdba7a6c","sum":"pytest-cov --cov=summem measures the no-suffix driver; tox -e coverage writes coverage/lcov.info (lcov SF path summem), while default tox stays coverage-free.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204638Z-78eb1773319c702b","text":"pytest-cov --cov=summem measures the no-suffix shebang; lcov SF path is summem.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T205716Z-2ff58bd8d1240b01","text":"tox -e coverage writes coverage/lcov.info via pytest-cov --cov=summem; default tox stays coverage-free.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e4a889eeb8ef62b8","sum":"Draft PR #23 archived: tox -e coverage uploads lcov to Codecov; README badge.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T210212Z-1d110b7fc5fdd2af","text":"Draft PR #23: tox -e coverage uploads lcov to Codecov; README badge.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T213032Z-d2f8289f08d361a6","text":"codecov-upload archived: tox -e coverage uploads lcov; README badge; draft PR #23.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"687bf44f7f1d1ca9","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; emergency delete is surgery.py; note-ack-surgery L4 capped; AGPL program, 0BSD+§7 in the summem header only (PR #32)","tree":{"c":[{"id":"75ea440c81cc93d7","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request (do not retry); emergency delete is surgery.py, not a subcommand","tree":{"c":[{"id":"08c734f3ed243af8","sum":"Root wake labels a non-empty git-root document; emergency delete is surgery.py (zipper out, unlink one note, heal_view), not a subcommand","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T233118Z-a3b7a5135628a4f0","text":"Root wake prints == Project-root Memories == when the git-root document is non-empty, catalog or not. Pull wakes stay unlabeled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T155541Z-842d10e98fbc74de","text":"Emergency delete is repo-root surgery.py, not a summem subcommand: zipper break-out of containing naps, unlink that one note, heal_view; it does not rewrite git history or write nap captions.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8c9885aa12cc2275","sum":"Successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; the nap is extra work on already-stored memory - do not retry the same note (PR #29 closed #27)","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260821T160046Z-f394b9340bcc2577","text":"Successful summem note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request. A nap after note is extra work on already-stored memory; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260821T160735Z-ea1c2c79f1a46533","text":"Draft PR #29 feat/note-ack closes #27: successful note prints Saved. then maybe a fold request; do not retry the same note.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4d2319ab67d787e7","sum":"note-ack-surgery L4 capped (#29+#30); program is AGPL, 0BSD prompt and §7 invocation live only in the summem header; LICENSE verbatim; surgery.py stock AGPL (PR #32)","tree":{"c":[{"id":"98bd8ec9648a6a8b","sum":"note-ack-surgery L4 capped (#29+#30 merged, archive on main). Program is AGPL; 0BSD prompt and §7 invocation permission live in the summem header (authoritative); LICENSE stays verbatim AGPL; surgery.py echoes invocation only.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260821T172411Z-b5e0645705ca3183","text":"L4 note-ack-surgery capped: #29 and #30 merged; capstone archive memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260821-note-ack-surgery.md on main.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260823T191515Z-afdba13a71a9e2b8","text":"Program is AGPL; prompt template is 0BSD and invocation is a section 7 additional permission, both in the summem header (authoritative). LICENSE stays verbatim AGPL; surgery.py echoes invocation only.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"55a93401f0823aa5","sum":"surgery.py stays stock AGPL; §7 invocation + 0BSD prompt live only in the summem header; agpl-carve-outs archived as PR #32","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260823T191944Z-6b284f7ab99096b8","text":"surgery.py stays stock AGPL. The section 7 invocation permission and 0BSD prompt terms live only in the summem header.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260823T193232Z-015b467b7a2c8879","text":"agpl-carve-outs archived to memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260823-agpl-carve-outs.md; draft PR #32.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"30168750c4c633f7","sum":"format_wake_line shared; named_ids catches tree-parse; fold_request --path if walk-up misses. Root how_to under Usage. Onboarding=init; 3.11 floor. Captions .summ. SLOBAC proofs; #48 14/60-63. Zoom pin=selected nap. Catalog git-visible /.summem/; unique-prefix; heal raw JSON.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f8270fbd698a350a","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; named_ids catches tree-parse errors; fold_request adds --path when walk-up would miss. Root wake prints how_to under Usage; skip a second when that block is still readable. Onboarding is init; 3.11 floor is right after import sys.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"3f064eaca2fcf0fe","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line (dated leaves, prefixed packs); recall matches text and captions; walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the tree; fold_request adds --path REL when walk-up would miss; 3.11 floor is right after import sys; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f47ceea4c51ec638","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: no parens; packs have no day; recall matches note text and captions; fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"15146632137cf430","sum":"fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store; wake dates leaves x1 YYYY-MM-DD: from the stamp, packs stay xN prefix: caption.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260823T212302Z-619f7114a3c3445b","text":"fold_request Run: includes --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would not select the folded store.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T142559Z-853c6c0b6ec510e9","text":"Wake leaf lines are x1 (YYYY-MM-DD): text from the filename stamp; nap lines stay xN prefix: caption with no day.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"87f86d77a75e4841","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: with no parens; recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T143849Z-bb7956f2f4651e25","text":"Wake leaf line is x1 YYYY-MM-DD: text, no parens; same xN TOKEN: body grammar as a pack.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T163806Z-5d0f4e137b683d7f","text":"Zoom and recall print the same wake grammar as wake (dated leaves, unique-prefix packs); recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f77cab1df115c25","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line and enqueue NapChild ids from the tree; 3.11 floor is immediately after import sys; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError; agent-display-unify is PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"38ea7198a3688568","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout; agent-display-unify archived as PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T165407Z-a27fb3a92805a5d6","text":"Recall and zoom print format_wake_line like wake; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout tokens.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T173019Z-27bced2c4e108fab","text":"agent-display-unify archived: wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; PR #37 on labelling.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1fcbcf0346304c1f","sum":"3.11 floor is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError on a non-mapping child.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174425Z-833402129b2e4377","text":"require_python in main() is too late: module-level import tomllib dies on Python 3.10 before SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174736Z-d428af9e8413115e","text":"named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS like the other tree readers, including AttributeError when a children-file child is not a mapping.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"58d640914b470b3e","sum":"Root wake prints how_to under Usage and catalogs other stores; skip a second root wake when that Usage block is still readable. Onboarding is init (bootstrap only); 3.11 floor is right after import sys.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5672e8d92ee69a50","sum":"equal_grain_pair is fold-test only; 3.11 floor is right after import sys (#42). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"61fbb8f64668e9b1","sum":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; fold_request walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself; sys.version_info is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints the floor message instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174900Z-adbb0c6c6a991bca","text":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; the copied driver does not keep it. fold_request still walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174934Z-b3f3d92f255bc910","text":"summem checks sys.version_info immediately after import sys and before import tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f3b2086879920a2","sum":"3.11 floor is import-time before tomllib (#42/#38). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T175246Z-a3c8d06b34d1a7c4","text":"PR #42 feat/require-python closes #38: import-time 3.11 floor before tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003315Z-1061fd623922ceb6","text":"Root wake prints how_to_text under == SumMem Usage ==; the AGENTS.md prefix is the bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"dcff76f4cde304af","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. Onboarding is init: prints the bootstrap (prompt_text()), writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. A consumer upgrade is copying the script. Root-wake catalog tests slice that section.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"961801789374c217","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. A consumer upgrade is copying the script; init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T003337Z-7415cd62d790d57b","text":"Skip a root wake when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable; do not skip on a remembered wake or the footer alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003343Z-32520d7e11eb7ac8","text":"A consumer upgrade is copying the script; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d0629b8c4f7d147a","sum":"Onboarding is init (prompt_text()); root-wake catalog tests slice the catalog section.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T004057Z-33f2fad52281ba51","text":"Root-wake tests that pin catalog shape must slice the catalog section; Usage contains .summem/summem and wake --path.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T133725Z-1b75d9fa0073870a","text":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); there is no docs/agents-prompt.md copy.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a01e0246698076f2","sum":"Nap captions are .summ. SLOBAC: proofs stay; 3.11 floor (no CI 3.10); findings 14, 60-63 kept (PR #48). Zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines. Catalog is git-visible /.summem/ paths; recall/zoom unique-prefix once, parse each view .tree once; heal is raw JSON.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"023ef6d783b9ba73","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum. SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet (proofs stay; 3.11 floor because CI has no 3.10). Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines. slobac-audit-ratchet archived PR #48 (findings 14, 60-63 kept).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"445d51b96a604dfb","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum; leftover .sum is not a caption. SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet applied (proofs stay; 3.11 floor because CI has no 3.10). Consumer .sum→.summ find recipe was on PR #47.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fadfed630d13aa36","sum":"Nap captions are .summ, not .sum; leftover .sum beside a .tree is not a caption. Consumer find recipe is on PR #47 for the squash BREAKING CHANGES footer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T153120Z-33fb53e74d638a8e","text":"Nap caption files are .summ; a leftover .sum beside a .tree is not a caption.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T160856Z-79b76d35d66fe702","text":"summ-caption-suffix archived: captions are .summ; consumer find recipe on PR #47 for squash BREAKING CHANGES.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7d9b22491a29a836","sum":"SLOBAC 2026-08-25 audit (284 tests) found 63 smells; ratchet applied. Proofs stay as file-backend acceptance; the 3.11-floor pin stays because CI has no 3.10.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T174056Z-e79674666263e761","text":"2026-08-25 SLOBAC all-smells audit of tests/ (284 tests): 63 deduplicated findings; largest clusters loose-text-oracle 30, vacuous-assertion 12, implementation-coupled 10; cross-suite confirmed 4 redundancies and proof-file fossils.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T180628Z-7d45f92e68433516","text":"SLOBAC 2026-08-25 ratchet applied to tests: proofs kept as file-backend acceptance; CI has no 3.10 so the source-order 3.11-floor pin stays.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"81969101cc5f4d48","sum":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines. slobac-audit-ratchet archived (19 fixes, PR #48; findings 14, 60-63 kept). Perf @5k: wake ~1ms, startup ~120ms, heal 81ms, recall short_id 19s, catalog walk 44ms vs ls-files 2.5ms","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a4ec8912daa1494d","sum":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*; zoom pin is the selected nap's two public wake lines; tox py311-py314 was 284.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T181644Z-3f292cfab0ac6216","text":"Process-level tests renamed off test_proof_*: worktree merge, caption conflict, squash-clone zoom, nap reject, branch-pack merge, path walk-up and catalog. First proof N gone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T185219Z-e6bb937a75148bd1","text":"QA PASS: test_zoom_expanded_child_id pins the selected nap's exact two public wake lines; tox py311-py314 each pass 284 tests.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"aa3c608f961e94cc","sum":"slobac-audit-ratchet archived: 19 fixes + PR #48 zoom pin; findings 14 and 60-63 kept. Perf audit @5k: wake ~1ms; startup ~120ms; heal 81ms/note; recall short_id 19s; catalog walk 44ms vs git ls-files 2.5ms","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T185552Z-c63aabf42fe2467f","text":"slobac-audit-ratchet archived: 19 ratchet fixes + Phase A rename + PR #48 zoom pin; findings 14 and 60-63 kept; memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260825-slobac-audit-ratchet.md","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T191431Z-3c64d129c6c9a0bb","text":"Perf audit: wake view ~1ms@5k leaves. Costs: ~120ms startup (compile 29ms; dataclasses/argparse/tomllib imports), heal reparses every .tree per note (81ms@5k), recall per-line short_id rescan (19s@5k common word), catalog os.walk+check-ignore 44ms vs git ls-files 2.5ms","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"107070bb94d80d9b","sum":"Perf shards: catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree once; named_ids shares that walk. Heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize/write_nap build Tree. Wave #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"78d34186f9c1d621","sum":"Perf shards #49/#50: catalog via one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Wave was #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0302e7603c8f235a","sum":"Perf shards filed: #49 catalog ls-files, #50 recall/zoom prefix+parse-once, #51 heal raw-JSON, #52 drop-dataclasses, #53 skip-heal (design). Wave #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52; close/defer ok.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T192652Z-f5aecd1900237e75","text":"Perf shards filed: #49 catalog ls-files, #50 recall/zoom prefix+parse-once, #51 heal raw-JSON walk, #52 startup dataclasses/lazy-import, #53 skip-heal marker (design)","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T193539Z-a762122c1565c2e3","text":"perf-shards L4: #49∥#50 then #51 then #53 then #52; parent operator; close/defer ok; parent L4 files stay off main until capstone.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f05f9b5376fd649a","sum":"Issues #49/#50: catalog via one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T193914Z-a87c411d06c19c31","text":"Issue #50: recall/zoom unique-prefix once per command (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Catalog/heal/dataclasses stay out.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T193954Z-611094457cb3dfa9","text":"Issue #49 plan: catalog_text becomes one git ls-files -z --cached --others --exclude-standard filtered for .summem/config.toml; _ignored_store goes away.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3def4ffb3ddeacd7","sum":"Catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once and parse each view .tree once (#50). Heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree (#51/#56).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fb6c804b59655564","sum":"catalog is one git ls-files of .summem/config.toml; recall/zoom unique-prefix once and parse each view .tree once (#50).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T195218Z-f3eba96c79b9d954","text":"Root catalog enumerates via one git ls-files --cached --others --exclude-standard filtered on .summem/config.toml; no committed index.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T200439Z-dff2e8353bdc9000","text":"recall-zoom-prefix archived: recall/zoom unique-prefix once per command (sort+neighbor LCP) and parse each view .tree at most once; named_ids shares that walk. Issue #50.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f3a4c22a002e4dd6","sum":"heal overlap is raw JSON; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree. PR #56 Fixes #51.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T200855Z-2670ea812d7405e3","text":"Issue #51: heal digest walk is raw JSON only; rematerialize and write_nap still build Tree when writing a pack.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T202339Z-0c3a676acf423f91","text":"Heal overlap checks walk raw tree JSON; note/nap thread one list_view and knobs. PR #56 Fixes #51.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
